# Runtime configuration for the Supabase-backed dashboard.
# Local development: copy to .env.local. Coolify: add as runtime variables.
APP_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:4317
SUPABASE_URL=
SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
NEXT_TELEMETRY_DISABLED=1

# No service-role/secret key is used by member or staff requests.
# Apply supabase/migrations in order to a new development project first.
# Configure Supabase Site URL and redirect allowlist for APP_BASE_URL/auth/callback.
# Existing NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL/PUBLISHABLE_KEY names are accepted as fallbacks;
# prefer the runtime-only names above for a portable Coolify image.
# Voice, billing, email delivery, retention workers and production deployment
# remain separate unverified integrations. See docs/DASHBOARD-SUPABASE.md.
# Incoming-call setup and staging checklist: docs/LIVE-LAUNCH-PREPARATION.md.
# Do not add Twilio, xAI, Resend, Square or Supabase privileged keys here.
# They belong to the isolated gateway/worker services when implemented.
# Offline launch check (prints no values): npm run check:launch -- .env.local
